# 🤖 Personal AI Playbook

A premium, interactive AI workflow management system that transforms everyday AI habits into reusable productivity systems.

Built as part of **ABTalks 60-Day Coding Challenge – Day 49**.

---

## 🚀 Overview

Personal AI Playbook helps users organize, build, and optimize their AI workflows instead of collecting hundreds of disconnected prompts.

The application interviews users to understand their work style and automatically generates personalized AI workflow systems.

Everything runs locally inside a single HTML file with no external dependencies.

---

## ✨ Features

### 🎯 Personalized AI Interview
- Guided onboarding
- Multiple-choice questions
- Discovers AI usage patterns
- Builds workflows based on user needs

### 📊 Interactive Dashboard
- Personalized overview
- AI workflow statistics
- Favorite workflows
- Recent activity

### 📝 Workflow Manager
- Create workflows
- Edit workflows
- Duplicate workflows
- Delete workflows
- Favorite workflows
- Search & Filter
- Local Storage support

### 🧩 Prompt Builder
Build prompts using reusable blocks:

- Role
- Objective
- Context
- Constraints
- Reasoning Strategy
- Tone
- Examples
- Output Format
- Quality Checks

Live prompt preview included.

---

### 🔄 Loop Builder

Convert normal prompts into autonomous AI systems using:

- Goal
- Evaluation Criteria
- Improvement Strategy
- Stop Conditions
- Safety Rules

---

### 📚 Reusable Prompt Systems

Instead of storing static prompts, the playbook generates modular prompt templates that can be customized with editable variables.

---

### 💾 Local Storage

Automatically saves:

- Workflows
- Favorites
- Preferences
- Settings

---

### 📤 Import & Export

- Export Playbook
- Import Existing Data
- Backup Workflows

---

### 🌙 Modern UI

- Beautiful Glassmorphism
- Dark Theme
- Responsive Design
- Smooth Animations
- Keyboard Shortcuts

